<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48745" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θηρίκλειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made by Thericles</i>, a famous Corinthian potter (<i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				31
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				43
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θ. κύλιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					96
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.3.2
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Cleanth.Stoic.
				1.133
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρατήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					119
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).124.43
			</span></i>, al. (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτήρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phalar.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					70
				</span></i>
			; freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θηρικλεία</span> (or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ος</span>) alone, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				226
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				324
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θ. ἡ μεγάλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diox.
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν Θηρικλείων εὐκύκλωτον ἀσπίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristopho
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα δ᾽ ἐστὶν εἴδη Θηρικλείων τῶν
					καλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dionys.Com.
					5.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
